            0.267,
            0.221,
            0.602,
            0.369
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Develop a bottle garden by planting a growing plant like spider plant or jade plant in a large transparent bottle (Fig. 10.13). After growing the plant properly for some time, seal the mouth of the bottle. Observe the growth of the"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
